<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH BEAT SAN MARINO 6-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH BEAT SAN MARINO 6-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>HEERENVEEN, Netherlands 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Netherlands</p>
<p>beat San Marino 6-0 (halftime 3-0) in a European under-21 soccer</p>
<p>championship group seven qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Makaay 9, Ommel 12, Reuser 19, Ricksen 53,</p>
<p>Musampa 64,71</p>
<p>Red cards: Marani (San Marino)</p>
<p>Yellow cards: Boateng (Netherlands), Bacchiocchi (San</p>
<p>Marino)</p>
<p>Attendance: 12,500</p>
<p>Standings </p>
<p>  Turkey	    3   3   0   0   8   1   9</p>
<p>  Wales	     5   3   0   2   8   5   9</p>
<p>  Netherlands     4   2   1   1   10  3   7</p>
<p>  Belgium	   3   1   1   1   8   5   4</p>
<p>  San Marino	5   0   0   5   1   21  0</p>
</text>
